title: NetExec SMB Lsassy Credential Dumping
status: experimental
description: Detects NetExec SMB activity invoking the Lsassy module, which may indicate an attempt to extract credentials from the LSASS process on a remote Windows system.
    - https://thedfirreport.com/2026/05/11/flash-alert-etherrat-and-tuktuk-c2-end-in-the-gentleman-ransomware/
author: Sümeyra Yüksel
date: 2026/10/21
tags:
    - attack.lateral-movement
    - attack.t1003.001
logsource:
    category: process_creation
    product: windows
detection:
    selection_cli:
        CommandLine|contains|all:
            - ' smb '
            - '-M lsassy'
    condition: selection_cli
fields:
    - Image
    - CommandLine
    - User
level: medium
